{
  "title": "The Story of the Man With One Ball",
  "tail": 3.9,
  "musicEnd": "L17",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L01",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "Where I'm from, we tell this one. There once was a man with the worst luck in the world."
    },
    {
      "id": "L02",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "Oh, and he only had one ball.",
      "post": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "L03",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "One day, he took a flight."
    },
    {
      "id": "L04",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "Halfway there, the engine died.",
      "post": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "L05",
      "who": "captain",
      "text": "Someone has to jump!",
      "post": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "L06",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "They drew a name. It was him."
    },
    {
      "id": "L07",
      "who": "hero",
      "text": "No way!",
      "post": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "L08",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "They drew again. Him. Again. Him. Five times in a row!",
      "post": 0.5
    },
    {
      "id": "L09",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "Finally, he said:"
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "who": "hero",
      "text": "Fine. One question. Get it right, and I'll jump."
    },
    {
      "id": "L11",
      "who": "hero",
      "text": "How many balls do this guy and I have, together?",
      "post": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "L12",
      "who": "crowd",
      "text": "Ha ha ha! Four!",
      "caption": "HA HA HA! FOUR!",
      "post": 0.4
    },
    {
      "id": "L13",
      "who": "hero",
      "text": "Wrong!",
      "post": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "L14",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "He showed his one ball.",
      "post": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "L15",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "Then the guy across the aisle stood up,",
      "post": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "L16",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "and showed his three.",
      "post": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "L17",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "One plus three. Four.",
      "post": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "L18",
      "who": "nar",
      "text": "And so... he jumped."
    }
  ]
}
